<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</view><view class="h1">安排成你的节奏</view><view class="sub">设置条件，生成可调整的候选路线。</view><view class="panel"><view class="label">停留时间</view><picker range="{{daysOptions}}" value="{{daysIndex}}" data-field="daysIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{daysOptions[daysIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="label">重点区域</view><picker range="{{districts}}" value="{{districtIndex}}" data-field="districtIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{districts[districtIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="label">兴趣主题</view><picker range="{{interests}}" value="{{interestIndex}}" data-field="interestIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{interests[interestIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="label">出行节奏</view><picker range="{{paces}}" value="{{paceIndex}}" data-field="paceIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{paces[paceIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="label">出发参考点</view><picker range="{{startOptions}}" value="{{startIndex}}" data-field="startIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{startOptions[startIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="label">预算上限（元）</view><input class="field" type="number" value="{{budget}}" bindinput="budget"/><view class="row between"><view class="label">雨天方案，优先室内</view><switch color="#507241" checked="{{rain}}" bindchange="rain"/></view><view class="notice">尚未接入可靠票价、餐饮和交通费用，无法保证实际花费符合预算。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="generate">生成并保存计划 →</button></view><view wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="h2">{{result.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{result.days}}" wx:key="day" wx:for-item="day" class="panel"><view class="eyebrow">DAY {{day.day}}</view><view class="meta">建议参观约 {{day.visitMinutes}} 分钟，不含交通与休息</view><view wx:for="{{day.stops}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="stop" class="article-row"><view class="title" data-id="{{stop.id}}" bindtap="place">{{index+1}}. {{stop.name}} ↗</view><view class="body">{{stop.summary}}</view><view class="meta">{{stop.district}} · 建议 {{stop.duration}} 分钟</view><view wx:if="{{index>0 && stop.straightKm!==null}}" class="meta">距上一点直线约 {{stop.straightKm}} km，不是导航距离</view><button class="link" data-source="{{stop.source}}" bindtap="source">{{stop.source.type==='dataset'?'查看地图记录，开放另核实':'查看来源并确认开放预约'}} ↗</button></view></view><view class="notice"><view wx:for="{{result.warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view><view>预算上限 {{result.budget.limit}} 元：{{result.budget.note}}</view></view></view><view class="h2">保存的计划</view><view wx:for="{{saved}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restore"><view class="title">{{item.title}} ↗</view></view></view>
